---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="about" title="About">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a backend engineer with over ten years of experience designing, building and
      operating distributed systems for products used across Europe and the US. I like
      owning a system end to end, from the first design discussion to how it behaves
      in production, and I've helped evolve systems from monoliths to microservices in
      mission-critical domains.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today I'm a technical lead at <a href="https://monta.com">Monta</a>, leading a team of
      six backend engineers on the platform behind an EV charging ecosystem. I work mostly in
      Kotlin and Java on AWS and Kubernetes, with Kafka and SQS for event-driven workflows
      and Prometheus, Loki, Tempo and Grafana to keep production observable.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've also built production LLM systems: a RAG platform for querying legal contracts,
      and AI-assisted invoice parsing with validation rules guarding every extracted record.
      I'm an AWS Certified Developer – Associate, based in Seville, Spain.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .prose {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
